## 4. Vehicle / pad variant

Same suit, different stand:

- Suit lives in a donning booth or on a vehicle wall with the hatch facing the aisle.
- Pack may already be on the hatch if the vehicle card allows a side-entry around a parked pack. Default MK.I is pack-last. Do not invent a third way mid-campaign.
- Abort-worn Case A: hatch stays locked, pack stays on, SEAs OPEN or HOLD as the abort card says, never impedance-follow a 6 g spike.

Lunar gravity step-in is the same sequence with less stand lean. Do not skip the yoke sit — 1/6 g still lets you miss the footbed and fold a knee convolute.

